Subject: [PATCH 3/3] 2026-11-model-listings: Add the provider directory and
 OpenAI-compatible providers

- Problem: providers are a researched shortlist too; an undeclared provider
  generates nothing.
- Outline: a broadly researched provider directory (the providers: section,
  extended), and an openai_compatible provider kind needing only a base URL
  and a key.
- New "How it feels to the owner" section (switching from OpenRouter to
  Chutes), criteria 10-12, open questions 9-11, suggested slices.

